   "source": [
    "# Week 3 Day 2：Plan-and-Execute / LLMCompiler\n",
    "\n",
    "目标：把复杂任务先编译成带依赖关系的计划，再按 DAG 分批执行。重点不是"列 todo"，而是让计划具备输入、输出、依赖和可重跑边界。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "w3d2-plan-execute-newcomer-guide",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 新手导读：Plan-and-Execute 是"先画施工图，再动手"\n",
    "\n",
    "ReAct 是边观察边行动，适合短任务和信息不确定的场景。Plan-and-Execute 适合多步骤、需要审计、可以提前拆解的任务。\n",
    "\n",
    "本节关键词：\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Plan**：把用户目标拆成步骤，每步有输入、输出、依赖。\n",
    "- **Execute**：按依赖顺序执行步骤，而不是靠模型每轮临时决定。\n",
    "- **DAG**：有向无环图，表示哪些步骤必须先做，哪些可以并行。\n",
    "- **LLMCompiler 思路**：把自然语言任务"编译"成可调度的执行图。\n",
    "\n",
    "阅读顺序建议：\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 先看 `PlanStep` 数据结构，理解一个合格计划步骤的字段。\n",
    "2. 再看 `build_plan` 输出的依赖图，不要急着看执行。\n",
    "3. 看 `ready_steps`，理解 DAG 调度是怎么判断"哪步可以跑"的。\n",
    "4. 看 `execute_plan`，理解依赖满足后才能执行。\n",
    "5. 最后看 `plan_to_mermaid`，把计划图可视化。\n",
    "\n",
    "常见误区：\n",
    "\n",
    "- 计划不是自然语言 todo list；工程计划必须有依赖和产物。\n",
    "- Plan-and-Execute 不一定比 ReAct 好。任务变化快、需要实时观察时，ReAct 更灵活。\n",
    "- 可并行不等于一定并行；先显式建 DAG，才有优化空间。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## ReAct vs Plan-and-Execute\n",
    "\n",
    "| 对比项 | ReAct | Plan-and-Execute | LLMCompiler |\n",
    "|--------|-------|-----------------|-------------|\n",
    "| 决策时机 | 每步执行后 | 全部提前规划 | 编译期分析依赖 |\n",
    "| 并行能力 | 有限 | 需手动设计 | DAG 自动识别 |\n",
    "| 适合场景 | 短任务/高动态 | 多步骤/可审计 | 复杂工作流/高吞吐 |\n",
    "| 错误恢复 | 观察后重试 | 重跑子图 | 只重跑受影响节点 |\n",
    "\n",
    "- ReAct：每一步都在观察后决定下一步，适合短任务、环境反馈频繁的任务。\n",
    "- Plan-and-Execute：先做全局规划，再执行，适合多步骤、可审计、可并行的任务。\n",
    "- LLMCompiler：进一步把计划变成依赖图，识别可以并行执行的节点。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-env-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 环境准备\n",
    "\n",
    "本节是**离线模拟**，不调用真实 LLM，也不需要 API Key。\n",
    "所有"执行器"由确定性 Python 函数模拟，目的是聚焦理解 DAG 调度的控制流。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-imports",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from __future__ import annotations\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "from dataclasses import dataclass, field\n",
    "from typing import Callable\n",
    "\n",
    "# Windows 终端 GBK 编码兼容\n",
    "if hasattr(sys.stdout, \"reconfigure\"):\n",
    "    sys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 要解决的任务\n",
    "TASK = \"为 research-assistant 增加一次论文调研回答的质量评估\"\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"环境初始化完成。本节是离线模拟，不依赖 API Key。\")\n",
    "print(f\"任务：{TASK}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-planstep-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. PlanStep 数据结构 —— 什么是合格的计划步骤\n",
    "\n",
    "普通 todo list 和工程计划的区别就在 `depends_on`：\n",
    "\n",
    "- todo list：`[\"第一步\", \"第二步\", \"第三步\"]` —— 只有顺序，没有依赖语义\n",
    "- 工程计划：每个步骤声明"我需要哪些步骤的输出才能运行"\n",
    "\n",
    "有了 `depends_on`，调度器才能：\n",
    "1. 检测循环依赖（A 依赖 B，B 依赖 A → 死锁）\n",
    "2. 找出可并行步骤（互不依赖的步骤可以同时运行）\n",
    "3. 只重跑失败步骤及其下游（增量执行）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-planstep",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "@dataclass(frozen=True)\n",
    "class PlanStep:\n",
    "    \"\"\"计划中的一个执行单元。frozen=True 防止计划被执行过程意外修改。\"\"\"\n",
    "    id: str                         # 唯一标识符，其他步骤用它声明依赖\n",
    "    title: str                      # 人类可读的步骤名称\n",
    "    action: str                     # 这个步骤要做什么（可以是提示词、代码路径等）\n",
    "    depends_on: tuple[str, ...] = ()  # 依赖哪些步骤的 id（空 tuple = 无依赖，可最先执行）\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 用一个最小示例理解依赖语义\n",
    "example_step = PlanStep(\n",
    "    id=\"score\",\n",
    "    title=\"实现打分器\",\n",
    "    action=\"按 rubric 检查回答是否引用证据、是否覆盖关键点。\",\n",
    "    depends_on=(\"rubric\", \"fixtures\"),  # 必须先有 rubric 和 fixtures 才能打分\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"PlanStep 示例：\")\n",
    "print(f\"  id         = {example_step.id}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  title      = {example_step.title}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  depends_on = {example_step.depends_on}\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"→ 这个步骤只有在 rubric 和 fixtures 都完成后才能执行\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-exec-state-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 执行状态数据结构\n",
    "\n",
    "执行过程需要两类状态：\n",
    "1. `ExecutionResult` —— 一个步骤执行完后的产物\n",
    "2. `ExecutionState` —— 整个任务的执行状态（已完成的步骤及其结果）\n",
    "\n",
    "`Executor` 是执行器的类型签名：接受步骤和当前状态，返回字符串输出。\n",
    "这个签名让执行器可插拔——离线模拟、真实 LLM 调用、工具调用都能适配。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-exec-state",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "@dataclass\n",
    "class ExecutionResult:\n",
    "    \"\"\"一个步骤执行完后的产物。\"\"\"\n",
    "    step_id: str\n",
    "    title: str\n",
    "    output: str    # 结构化产物，下游步骤会从 state.completed[step_id].output 读取\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "@dataclass\n",
    "class ExecutionState:\n",
    "    \"\"\"整个任务的执行状态，跟踪已完成的步骤及其输出。\"\"\"\n",
    "    task: str\n",
    "    # completed 的 key 是 step_id，value 是对应的 ExecutionResult\n",
    "    # 调度器用 set(completed.keys()) 判断哪些步骤已完成\n",
    "    completed: dict[str, ExecutionResult] = field(default_factory=dict)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# Executor 是执行器的类型签名\n",
    "# Callable[[PlanStep, ExecutionState], str] 表示：接受步骤和状态，返回字符串\n",
    "Executor = Callable[[PlanStep, ExecutionState], str]\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"数据结构定义完成：\")\n",
    "print(\"  ExecutionResult.output  → 步骤产物，下游步骤可从 state.completed 读取\")\n",
    "print(\"  ExecutionState.completed → 已完成步骤的 {id: result} 映射\")\n",
    "print(\"  Executor                → 可插拔的执行器类型签名\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-build-plan-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. build_plan —— 把目标编译成 DAG\n",
    "\n",
    "这一步是 Plan-and-Execute 和 LLMCompiler 的"编译"阶段。\n",
    "\n",
    "生产中 `build_plan` 通常是一次 LLM 调用：\n",
    "- 输入：用户的自然语言目标\n",
    "- 输出：结构化的 `list[PlanStep]`，包含依赖关系\n",
    "\n",
    "**本练习的计划 DAG：**\n",
    "```\n",
    "start\n",
    "  └──→ inspect\n",
    "         ├──→ rubric   ─┐\n",
    "         └──→ fixtures  ├──→ score ──→ report\n",
    "                        ┘\n",
    "```\n",
    "rubric 和 fixtures 都只依赖 inspect，可以并行执行。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-build-plan",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def build_plan(task: str = TASK) -> list[PlanStep]:\n",
    "    \"\"\"把用户目标编译成有依赖关系的计划，而不是线性 todo。\"\"\"\n",
    "    return [\n",
    "        PlanStep(\n",
    "            id=\"inspect\",\n",
    "            title=\"确认评估对象\",\n",
    "            action=\"阅读 research-assistant 的输入输出接口和已有 self-test。\",\n",
    "            # depends_on 为空 tuple → 无前置依赖，可以最先执行\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "        PlanStep(\n",
    "            id=\"rubric\",\n",
    "            title=\"设计评估标准\",\n",
    "            action=\"定义 groundedness、citation、coverage、conciseness 四个维度。\",\n",
    "            depends_on=(\"inspect\",),   # 必须先了解接口，才能设计对应的评估标准\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "        PlanStep(\n",
    "            id=\"fixtures\",\n",
    "            title=\"准备样例数据\",\n",
    "            action=\"构造一个论文问题、三条证据和一个候选回答。\",\n",
    "            depends_on=(\"inspect\",),   # 同样依赖 inspect，但与 rubric 互不依赖 → 可并行\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "        PlanStep(\n",
    "            id=\"score\",\n",
    "            title=\"实现打分器\",\n",
    "            action=\"按 rubric 检查回答是否引用证据、是否覆盖关键点。\",\n",
    "            depends_on=(\"rubric\", \"fixtures\"),  # 需要 rubric 规则 AND 样例数据\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "        PlanStep(\n",
    "            id=\"report\",\n",
    "            title=\"生成评估报告\",\n",
    "            action=\"汇总分数、失败原因和下一步修复建议。\",\n",
    "            depends_on=(\"score\",),     # 必须有分数才能出报告\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 查看计划结构\n",
    "plan = build_plan()\n",
    "print(f\"计划共 {len(plan)} 步：\")\n",
    "for step in plan:\n",
    "    deps = \" → 依赖 \" + str(step.depends_on) if step.depends_on else \" → 无依赖（可最先执行）\"\n",
    "    print(f\"  [{step.id}] {step.title}{deps}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-ready-steps-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. ready_steps —— DAG 调度器的核心\n",
    "\n",
    "`ready_steps` 是整个 DAG 调度的判断逻辑，回答一个问题：\n",
    "\n",
    "**"当前哪些步骤的前置依赖都已完成，可以执行了？"**\n",
    "\n",
    "调度循环每批次调一次 `ready_steps`：\n",
    "- 返回的步骤列表 = 本批次可以并行执行的步骤\n",
    "- 执行完、放入 completed 后，下一批次可能有新步骤就绪\n",
    "- 如果返回空列表而 plan 没执行完 → 存在循环依赖或缺失依赖"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-ready-steps",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def ready_steps(plan: list[PlanStep], completed: set[str]) -> list[PlanStep]:\n",
    "    \"\"\"返回所有前置依赖都已满足、且尚未执行的步骤。\"\"\"\n",
    "    return [\n",
    "        step for step in plan\n",
    "        if step.id not in completed                       # 还没执行过\n",
    "        and all(dep in completed for dep in step.depends_on)  # 所有依赖都已完成\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 手动模拟调度过程，观察每批次哪些步骤就绪\n",
    "print(\"手动模拟 DAG 调度过程：\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "\n",
    "completed_sim: set[str] = set()\n",
    "batch = 1\n",
    "while len(completed_sim) < len(plan):\n",
    "    current_batch = ready_steps(plan, completed_sim)\n",
    "    ids = [s.id for s in current_batch]\n",
    "    print(f\"批次 {batch}：可执行 {ids}\")\n",
    "    if len(ids) > 1:\n",
    "        print(f\"  → 这些步骤互不依赖，生产中可以并行执行\")\n",
    "    for step in current_batch:\n",
    "        completed_sim.add(step.id)  # 模拟执行完成\n",
    "    batch += 1\n",
    "    print()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-executor-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. 执行器 —— 每个步骤的实际动作\n",
    "\n",
    "`default_executor` 是离线模拟执行器。\n",
    "\n",
    "**生产中执行器可以是：**\n",
    "- LLM 调用：`client.chat.completions.create(messages=[{\"role\":\"user\", \"content\": step.action}])`\n",
    "- 工具调用：在 step.action 里指定工具名和参数\n",
    "- 代码运行：subprocess / docker sandbox\n",
    "\n",
    "注意 `score` 步骤的执行器：它从 `state.completed` 读取 `rubric` 和 `fixtures` 的输出。\n",
    "这就是 `ExecutionState` 的价值——让下游步骤能访问上游的结构化产物。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-executor",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def default_executor(step: PlanStep, state: ExecutionState) -> str:\n",
    "    \"\"\"离线模拟执行器：真实项目中可替换成工具调用、代码运行或 LLM 调用。\"\"\"\n",
    "    if step.id == \"inspect\":\n",
    "        return \"确认目标接口：输入 question/context/answer，输出结构化评估结果。\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    if step.id == \"rubric\":\n",
    "        return \"rubric=groundedness,citation,coverage,conciseness；每项 0/1。\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    if step.id == \"fixtures\":\n",
    "        return \"fixtures=论文问题 + context pack top evidence + 候选回答。\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    if step.id == \"score\":\n",
    "        # 关键：score 步骤从 state.completed 读取上游产物，而不是重新生成\n",
    "        rubric = state.completed[\"rubric\"].output\n",
    "        fixtures = state.completed[\"fixtures\"].output\n",
    "        return f\"score=3/4；已使用 {rubric} 与 {fixtures}；缺少 conciseness 约束。\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    if step.id == \"report\":\n",
    "        score = state.completed[\"score\"].output\n",
    "        return f\"report: {score} 建议加入 120 字限制与证据 ID 引用检查。\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    raise ValueError(f\"未知步骤: {step.id}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"default_executor 定义完成。\")\n",
    "print(\"注意 score 步骤会从 state.completed 读取 rubric 和 fixtures 的产物。\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-execute-plan-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. execute_plan —— 按 DAG 分批执行\n",
    "\n",
    "这是整个 Plan-and-Execute 的执行引擎，核心逻辑：\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "while 有步骤未执行:\n",
    "    batch = ready_steps(plan, completed)   # 找出本批次可执行的步骤\n",
    "    if batch 为空 → 循环依赖，报错\n",
    "    for step in batch:\n",
    "        output = executor(step, state)     # 执行（串行或并行）\n",
    "        state.completed[step.id] = result  # 记录产物\n",
    "    batches.append(batch_results)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "当前实现是串行的（for step in batch_steps）。\n",
    "生产中可用 `asyncio.gather` 或线程池对 batch_steps 做并行执行。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-execute-plan",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def execute_plan(\n",
    "    plan: list[PlanStep],\n",
    "    executor: Executor = default_executor,\n",
    "    task: str = TASK,\n",
    ") -> list[list[ExecutionResult]]:\n",
    "    \"\"\"按 DAG 分批执行；同一批里的步骤没有依赖关系，可并行。\"\"\"\n",
    "    state = ExecutionState(task=task)\n",
    "    batches: list[list[ExecutionResult]] = []\n",
    "\n",
    "    while len(state.completed) < len(plan):\n",
    "        # 找出本批次就绪的步骤\n",
    "        batch_steps = ready_steps(plan, set(state.completed))\n",
    "\n",
    "        if not batch_steps:\n",
    "            # 就绪列表为空但还有未完成步骤 → 必然是循环依赖或依赖项 id 拼错\n",
    "            pending = [step.id for step in plan if step.id not in state.completed]\n",
    "            raise RuntimeError(f\"计划存在循环依赖或缺失依赖: {pending}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "        # 执行本批次（当前串行；生产可换成 asyncio.gather 并行）\n",
    "        batch: list[ExecutionResult] = []\n",
    "        for step in batch_steps:\n",
    "            output = executor(step, state)\n",
    "            result = ExecutionResult(step_id=step.id, title=step.title, output=output)\n",
    "            batch.append(result)\n",
    "\n",
    "        # 整批结果一次性写入 state，保证同批次内的步骤看不到彼此的输出\n",
    "        for result in batch:\n",
    "            state.completed[result.step_id] = result\n",
    "        batches.append(batch)\n",
    "\n",
    "    return batches\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"execute_plan 定义完成。\")\n",
    "print(\"返回 list[list[ExecutionResult]]，外层是批次，内层是同批次的执行结果。\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Mermaid 可视化\n",
    "\n",
    "`plan_to_mermaid` 把计划转成 Mermaid flowchart 语法，方便在 GitHub / Notion / Obsidian 里渲染。\n",
    "\n",
    "同一批次中的节点没有互相依赖，可以并行执行。\n",
    "这里 `rubric` 和 `fixtures` 都只依赖 `inspect`，所以可以并行。\n",
    "\n",
    "**查看 Mermaid 图渲染效果：**  \n",
    "把下面 cell 的输出粘贴到 https://mermaid.live/ 即可可视化。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-mermaid",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def plan_to_mermaid(plan: list[PlanStep]) -> str:\n",
    "    \"\"\"把计划转成 Mermaid flowchart 语法，可视化依赖关系。\"\"\"\n",
    "    lines = [\"graph TD\"]\n",
    "    for step in plan:\n",
    "        label = f\"{step.id}[{step.title}]\"\n",
    "        if not step.depends_on:\n",
    "            # 无依赖的步骤从虚拟起点 start 出发\n",
    "            lines.append(f\"  start((任务)) --> {label}\")\n",
    "        for dep in step.depends_on:\n",
    "            # 有依赖的步骤从每个依赖项连箭头\n",
    "            lines.append(f\"  {dep} --> {label}\")\n",
    "    return \"\\n\".join(lines)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 打印 Mermaid 语法\n",
    "mermaid_code = plan_to_mermaid(plan)\n",
    "print(mermaid_code)\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"→ 把上面内容粘贴到 https://mermaid.live/ 即可查看依赖图\")\n",
    "print(\"→ rubric 和 fixtures 同属批次 2，在图里会从同一个节点出发，可以并行\")"
   ]
  },
